    "",
    "# Local stubs",
    "",
    "- [`LightData`] stands in for",
    "  `net.minestom.server.network.packet.server.play.data.LightData`; the",
    "  `play.data` package belongs to another porting wave, so the record lives",
    "  here.",
    "- Java's four `BitSet` masks are written with `NetworkBuffer.BITSET`, which",
    "  is `BYTE_ARRAY.transform(BitSet::valueOf, BitSet::toByteArray)` \u2014 a var-int",
    "  length plus the set's bytes. `java.util.BitSet` itself is not ported, and",
    "  the port has no bit-set type, so each mask is carried as those bytes",
    "  ([`LightData::sky_mask`] and friends), which is exactly the wire form."
  ],
